WEBVTT

00:04:57.601 --> 00:05:00.363
Which is that the N-word
is not just a word.

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:05.523
It's not neatly contained
in a racist past,

00:05:05.547 --> 00:05:07.624
a relic of slavery.

00:05:09.236 --> 00:05:15.513
Fundamentally, the N-word
is an idea disguised as a word:

00:05:15.537 --> 00:05:18.751
that black people are intellectually,

00:05:18.775 --> 00:05:20.331
biologically

00:05:20.355 --> 00:05:24.375
and immutably inferior to white people.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:28.978
And -- and I think
this is the most important part --

00:05:29.002 --> 00:05:32.685
that that inferiority means
that the injustice we suffer